				<r3d:description language="eng">ARCHE (A Resource Centre for the HumanitiEs) is a service by the Austrian Centre for Digital Humanities ACDH) of the Austrian Academy of Sciences (OeAW) aimed at offering stable and persistent hosting as well as dissemination of digital research data and resources for the Austrian humanities community. ARCHE welcomes data from all humanities fields.
ARCHE is the successor of the Language Resources Portal (LRP) and acts as Austria’s connection point to the European network of CLARIN Centres for language resources.</r3d:description>
